      keyLabs: ["CBC with differential, platelets, creatinine/eGFR, urine protein before cidofovir, calcium, magnesium, potassium, phosphate, and liver tests as indicated", "CMV disease-site examination, ophthalmologic findings, viral load in the appropriate context, immune recovery, hydration, neurologic status, and resistance testing after true virologic failure"],
